{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-2151","published":"2026-05-03T11:11:08Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:50.619512113Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-4367"],"summary":"libXpm security update","details":"X.Org X11 libXpm runtime library\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA vulnerability was found in X.org libXpm up to 3.5.4. It has been classified as problematic.CWE is classifying the issue as CWE-125. The product reads data past the end, or before the beginning, of the intended buffer.This is going to have an impact on confidentiality.Upgrading to version 3.5.19 eliminates this vulnerability. Applying the patch 5448e1bd is able to eliminate this problem. The bugfix is ready for download at gitlab.freedesktop.org. The best possible mitigation is suggested to be upgrading to the latest version.(CVE-2026-4367)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libXpm","ecosystem":"openEuler:20.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/libXpm&distro=openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.5.13-4.oe2003sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["libXpm-3.5.13-4.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","libXpm-debuginfo-3.5.13-4.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","libXpm-debugsource-3.5.13-4.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","libXpm-devel-3.5.13-4.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["libXpm-help-3.5.13-4.oe2003sp4.noarch.rpm"],"src":["libXpm-3.5.13-4.oe2003sp4.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["libXpm-3.5.13-4.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","libXpm-debuginfo-3.5.13-4.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","libXpm-debugsource-3.5.13-4.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","libXpm-devel-3.5.13-4.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-2151.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libXpm","ecosystem":"openEuler:22.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/libXpm&distro=openEuler-22.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.5.13-6.oe2203sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["libXpm-3.5.13-6.oe2203sp4.aarch64.rpm","libXpm-debuginfo-3.5.13-6.oe2203sp4.